# Uses only input and let statements, so its generated C builds with
# causa/runtime/causa_runtime.h alone (no causa_runtime.c); see docs/demonstration.md.
# It prints nothing. Its exit status says whether every value could be computed:
#   no arguments      exit 0
#   --set units=0     runtime error R101 (division by zero) at 8:22, exit 2
input total = 88.375
input units = 4
let per_unit = total / units
